+- `--threshold <metric>=<min>` – gate the build on a metric score (can be given multiple times). A metric passes when its score is at least the minimum; a metric with no score fails its threshold. Exit code 0 if all pass, 1 if any fail, 2 on malformed input. Reports are written either way and record the outcome. Without `--threshold`, reports and exit codes stay as they are today.
 
